A retail company is building a customer-facing chatbot that accepts both product photos and text questions, then responds with natural-language descriptions and recommendations.

A developer writes the following call:

```python
response = client.chat.completions.create(
    model="gpt-4o",
    messages=[
        {
            "role": "user",
            "content": [
                {"type": "image_url", "image_url": {"url": image_url}},
                {"type": "text", "text": user_question}
            ]
        }
    ]
)
```

Which Azure deployment type must back the `gpt-4o` model name for this call to succeed?
